\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O COME, all ye faithful,
\par Joyful and triumphant,
\par Come ye, O come ye to Bethlehem;
\par Come and behold Him
\par Born the King of angels:
\par O come, let us adore Him, 
\par Christ the Lord.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. True God of true God,
\par Light of Light eternal,
\par Lo! He abhors not the Virgin's womb,
\par Son of the Father,
\par Begotten, not created:
\par O come, let us adore Him, 
\par Christ the Lord.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Sing, choirs of angels,
\par Sing in exultation,
\par Sing, all ye citizens of heaven above,
\par Glory to God
\par In the highest:
\par O come, let us adore Him, 
\par Christ the Lord.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Yea, Lord, we greet Thee,
\par Born this happy morning;
\par Jesus, to Thee be glory given,
\par Word of the Father,
\par Now in flesh appearing:
\par O come, let us adore Him, 
\par Christ the Lord.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

